.</h2>"},{"title":"Hello World","_content":"Welcome to [Hexo](https://hexo.io/)! This is your very first post. Check [documentation](https://hexo.io/docs/) for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in [troubleshooting](https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html) or you can ask me on [GitHub](https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Create a new post\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo new \"My New Post\"\n```\n\nMore info: [Writing](https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html)\n\n### Run server\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo server\n```\n\nMore info: [Server](https://hexo.io/docs/server.html)\n\n### Generate static files\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo generate\n```\n\nMore info: [Generating](https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html)\n\n### Deploy to remote sites\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo deploy\n```\n\nMore info: [Deployment](https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html)\n","source":"_posts/hello-world.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Hello World\n---\nWelcome to [Hexo](https://hexo.io/)! This is your very first post. Check [documentation](https://hexo.io/docs/) for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in [troubleshooting](https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html) or you can ask me on [GitHub](https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Create a new post\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo new \"My New Post\"\n```\n\nMore info: [Writing](https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html)\n\n### Run server\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo server\n```\n\nMore info: [Server](https://hexo.io/docs/server.html)\n\n### Generate static files\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo generate\n```\n\nMore info: [Generating](https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html)\n\n### Deploy to remote sites\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo deploy\n```\n\nMore info: [Deployment](https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html)\n","slug":"hello-world","published":1,"date":"2025-10-03T13:49:22.137Z","updated":"1985-10-26T08:15:00.000Z","comments":1,"layout":"post","photos":[],"_id":"cmsss2c0w0001bcvg9uo2dvni","content":"<p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://hexo.io/\">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/\">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html\">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"Quick-Start\"><a href=\"#Quick-Start\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Quick Start\"></a>Quick Start</h2><h3 id=\"Create-a-new-post\"><a href=\"#Create-a-new-post\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Create a new post\"></a>Create a new post</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo new <span class=\"string\">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html\">Writing</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Run-server\"><a href=\"#Run-server\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Run server\"></a>Run server</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/server.html\">Server</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Generate-static-files\"><a href=\"#Generate-static-files\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Generate static files\"></a>Generate static files</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html\">Generating</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Deploy-to-remote-sites\"><a href=\"#Deploy-to-remote-sites\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Deploy to remote sites\"></a>Deploy to remote sites</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html\">Deployment</a></p>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://hexo.io/\">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/\">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html\">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"Quick-Start\"><a href=\"#Quick-Start\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Quick Start\"></a>Quick Start</h2><h3 id=\"Create-a-new-post\"><a href=\"#Create-a-new-post\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Create a new post\"></a>Create a new post</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo new <span class=\"string\">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html\">Writing</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Run-server\"><a href=\"#Run-server\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Run server\"></a>Run server</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/server.html\">Server</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Generate-static-files\"><a href=\"#Generate-static-files\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Generate static files\"></a>Generate static files</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html\">Generating</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Deploy-to-remote-sites\"><a href=\"#Deploy-to-remote-sites\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Deploy to remote sites\"></a>Deploy to remote sites</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html\">Deployment</a></p>\n"},{"title":"城堡 The Castle 题解","date":"2026-08-15T01:02:39.000Z","_content":"题目地址: https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1457#ide\n\n{% raw %}\n#include<iostream>\n#include<vector>\nusing namespace std;\nvector<int>pre(3010);//并查集\nint h[4][2]={{0,-1},{-1,0},{0,1},{1,0}};\nint find(int x){\n    if(x==pre[x])return x;\n    return pre[x]=find(pre[x]);\n}\nvoid join(int x,int y){\n    pre[find(x)]=find(y);\n}\nint main(){\n    int m,n;\n    cin>>m>>n;\n    int i,j;\n    int s=n*m;\n    for(i=1;i<=s;i++)pre[i]=i;\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            int u;\n            cin>>u;\n            for(int k=0;k<4;k++){\n                if(!(u&1))join((i-1)*m+j,(i+h[k][0]-1)*m+j+h[k][1]);\n                u>>=1;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    vector<int>v(3010);\n    int c1=0,c2=0;\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            v[find((i-1)*m+j)]++;\n        }\n    }\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            if(v[(i-1)*m+j])c1++,c2=max(c2,v[(i-1)*m+j]);\n        }\n    }\n    cout<<c1<<'\\n'<<c2<<'\\n';\n    int ans=0;\n    int x=0,y=0;\n    char c='N';\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){//从西到东\n            for(i=n;i>=1;i--){//从南到北\n            for(int k=1;k<=2;k++){\n                int x1=i+h[k][0];\n                int y1=j+h[k][1];\n                if(x1<1||x1>n||y1<1||y1>m||find((i-1)*m+j)==find((x1-1)*m+y1))continue;\n                int sum=v[find((i-1)*m+j)]+v[find((x1-1)*m+y1)];\n                if(ans<sum){\n                    ans=sum;\n                    x=i;\n                    y=j;\n                    c=(k==1?'N':'E');\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    cout<<ans<<'\\n';\n    cout<<x<<\" \"<<y<<\" \"<<c;\n    return 0;\n}\n{% endraw %}\n---","source":"_posts/城堡-The-Castle-题解.md","raw":"---\ntitle: 城堡 The Castle 题解\ndate: 2026-08-15 09:02:39\ntags:\n---\n题目地址: https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1457#ide\n\n{% raw %}\n#include<iostream>\n#include<vector>\nusing namespace std;\nvector<int>pre(3010);//并查集\nint h[4][2]={{0,-1},{-1,0},{0,1},{1,0}};\nint find(int x){\n    if(x==pre[x])return x;\n    return pre[x]=find(pre[x]);\n}\nvoid join(int x,int y){\n    pre[find(x)]=find(y);\n}\nint main(){\n    int m,n;\n    cin>>m>>n;\n    int i,j;\n    int s=n*m;\n    for(i=1;i<=s;i++)pre[i]=i;\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            int u;\n            cin>>u;\n            for(int k=0;k<4;k++){\n                if(!(u&1))join((i-1)*m+j,(i+h[k][0]-1)*m+j+h[k][1]);\n                u>>=1;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    vector<int>v(3010);\n    int c1=0,c2=0;\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            v[find((i-1)*m+j)]++;\n        }\n    }\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            if(v[(i-1)*m+j])c1++,c2=max(c2,v[(i-1)*m+j]);\n        }\n    }\n    cout<<c1<<'\\n'<<c2<<'\\n';\n    int ans=0;\n    int x=0,y=0;\n    char c='N';\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){//从西到东\n            for(i=n;i>=1;i--){//从南到北\n            for(int k=1;k<=2;k++){\n                int x1=i+h[k][0];\n                int y1=j+h[k][1];\n                if(x1<1||x1>n||y1<1||y1>m||find((i-1)*m+j)==find((x1-1)*m+y1))continue;\n                int sum=v[find((i-1)*m+j)]+v[find((x1-1)*m+y1)];\n                if(ans<sum){\n                    ans=sum;\n                    x=i;\n                    y=j;\n                    c=(k==1?'N':'E');\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    cout<<ans<<'\\n';\n    cout<<x<<\" \"<<y<<\" \"<<c;\n    return 0;\n}\n{% endraw %}\n---","slug":"城堡-The-Castle-题解","published":1,"updated":"2026-08-15T01:12:32.499Z","_id":"cmstogepl00004svg5qr2fd0o","comments":1,"layout":"post","photos":[],"content":"<p>题目地址: <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1457#ide\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1457#ide</a></p>\n\n#include<iostream>\n#include<vector>\nusing namespace std;\nvector<int>pre(3010);//并查集\nint h[4][2]={{0,-1},{-1,0},{0,1},{1,0}};\nint find(int x){\n    if(x==pre[x])return x;\n    return pre[x]=find(pre[x]);\n}\nvoid join(int x,int y){\n    pre[find(x)]=find(y);\n}\nint main(){\n    int m,n;\n    cin>>m>>n;\n    int i,j;\n    int s=n*m;\n    for(i=1;i<=s;i++)pre[i]=i;\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            int u;\n            cin>>u;\n            for(int k=0;k<4;k++){\n                if(!(u&1))join((i-1)*m+j,(i+h[k][0]-1)*m+j+h[k][1]);\n                u>>=1;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    vector<int>v(3010);\n    int c1=0,c2=0;\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            v[find((i-1)*m+j)]++;\n        }\n    }\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            if(v[(i-1)*m+j])c1++,c2=max(c2,v[(i-1)*m+j]);\n        }\n    }\n    cout<<c1<<'\\n'<<c2<<'\\n';\n    int ans=0;\n    int x=0,y=0;\n    char c='N';\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){//从西到东\n            for(i=n;i>=1;i--){//从南到北\n            for(int k=1;k<=2;k++){\n                int x1=i+h[k][0];\n                int y1=j+h[k][1];\n                if(x1<1||x1>n||y1<1||y1>m||find((i-1)*m+j)==find((x1-1)*m+y1))continue;\n                int sum=v[find((i-1)*m+j)]+v[find((x1-1)*m+y1)];\n                if(ans<sum){\n                    ans=sum;\n                    x=i;\n                    y=j;\n                    c=(k==1?'N':'E');\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    cout<<ans<<'\\n';\n    cout<<x<<\" \"<<y<<\" \"<<c;\n    return 0;\n}\n\n<hr>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<p>题目地址: <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1457#ide\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P1457#ide</a></p>\n\n#include<iostream>\n#include<vector>\nusing namespace std;\nvector<int>pre(3010);//并查集\nint h[4][2]={{0,-1},{-1,0},{0,1},{1,0}};\nint find(int x){\n    if(x==pre[x])return x;\n    return pre[x]=find(pre[x]);\n}\nvoid join(int x,int y){\n    pre[find(x)]=find(y);\n}\nint main(){\n    int m,n;\n    cin>>m>>n;\n    int i,j;\n    int s=n*m;\n    for(i=1;i<=s;i++)pre[i]=i;\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            int u;\n            cin>>u;\n            for(int k=0;k<4;k++){\n                if(!(u&1))join((i-1)*m+j,(i+h[k][0]-1)*m+j+h[k][1]);\n                u>>=1;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    vector<int>v(3010);\n    int c1=0,c2=0;\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            v[find((i-1)*m+j)]++;\n        }\n    }\n    for(i=1;i<=n;i++){\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){\n            if(v[(i-1)*m+j])c1++,c2=max(c2,v[(i-1)*m+j]);\n        }\n    }\n    cout<<c1<<'\\n'<<c2<<'\\n';\n    int ans=0;\n    int x=0,y=0;\n    char c='N';\n        for(j=1;j<=m;j++){//从西到东\n            for(i=n;i>=1;i--){//从南到北\n            for(int k=1;k<=2;k++){\n                int x1=i+h[k][0];\n                int y1=j+h[k][1];\n                if(x1<1||x1>n||y1<1||y1>m||find((i-1)*m+j)==find((x1-1)*m+y1))continue;\n                int sum=v[find((i-1)*m+j)]+v[find((x1-1)*m+y1)];\n                if(ans<sum){\n                    ans=sum;\n                    x=i;\n                    y=j;\n                    c=(k==1?'N':'E');\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    cout<<ans<<'\\n';\n    cout<<x<<\" \"<<y<<\" \"<<c;\n    return 0;\n}\n\n<hr>\n"}],"PostAsset":[],"PostCategory":[],"PostTag":[],"Tag":[]}}